Cinematic, hyper-detailed medium close-up portrait of a young woman with dark, drenched hair cascading over her shoulders. Her gaze is intensely direct, magnetic, and sultry. Her arms are raised, fingers delicately touching the crown of her head, drawing focus to intricate, lush floral tattoos that snake across her shoulders and upper arms, accentuating the wet sheen of her skin. Her medium breasts are strikingly exposed, glistening with droplets of water tracing paths down her cleavage and nipples. The lighting is aggressively dramatic, utilizing strong chiaroscuro effects—high contrast natural sunlight pouring in from massive, gridded windows behind her, sculpting the topography of her body with highlights and deep, velvety shadows. The environment suggests a richly textured, slightly decadent interior, perhaps an antique Parisian studio or clandestine late-afternoon cafe. The mood is intensely intimate, raw, and dangerously alluring. Shot on a prime lens, ultra-high resolution, cinematic color grading, wet look, hyperrealism, editorial fashion photography, soft focus on edges, dramatic shadows.